<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Faculty Guidelines | Skill Record</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body style="background: var(--bg-darker); padding: 60px 20px;">

    <div class="auth-card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 30px;">Mentor Guidelines</h2>
        
        <div style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">
            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">1. Professional Conduct</strong>
            Mentors are expected to provide constructive feedback to students and maintain professional standards of communication.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">2. Review Process</strong>
            Faculty members should review student submissions in a timely manner and provide guidance to help students improve their technical logs.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">3. Data Access</strong>
            Mentors have access to student records within their department. This data must be handled with confidentiality and used only for educational purposes.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">4. Mentorship Goals</strong>
            The goal of this platform is to bridge the gap between classroom learning and industrial requirements through consistent tracking.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">5. Reporting Issues</strong>
            Technical issues or instances of student misconduct should be reported to the platform administrator immediately.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 40px;">
            <button type="button" class="auth-btn" style="flex: 1;" onclick="window.location.href='/faculty/signup'">Accept & Continue</button>
            <button type="button" class="cta-btn cta-btn-secondary" style="flex: 1;" onclick="window.location.href='/'">Decline</button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>